From b7122940957884c1e4a2416955f91fabb8e0a9b1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Craterbrain <58347640+Craterbrain@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 20:49:50 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 29/75] PlaitOS: adapt network traffic monitor to GrapheneOS

- Layout and transitions use com.android.systemui.statusbar.NetworkTraffic
- Settings are plain Settings.Secure plait_network_traffic_* keys, read for
  the current user (mode 0 = off, the default), instead of LineageSettings
- No MAINLINE_NETWORK_STACK: per-interface TrafficStats need no permission

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WNZzm3ssZ7eH5QDg4P9AiP
